   "source": [
    "## Overall State Performance Score\n",
    "\n",
    "This visualization combines the key performance indicators into a single overall score for each state.\n",
    "\n",
    "The score is based on four equally weighted metrics:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Total Revenue\n",
    "- Total Profit\n",
    "- Average Post-Tax Profit Margin\n",
    "- Average Total Tax Rate\n",
    "\n",
    "To ensure comparability, each metric is normalized to a scale between 0 and 1. The tax score is inverted so that lower tax rates contribute positively to the overall performance score."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "a01c5ba0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1000x500 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "ranking = df_clean.groupby(\"State\").agg({\n",
    "    \"Revenue\": \"sum\",\n",
    "    \"Profit\": \"sum\",\n",
    "    \"PostTaxProfitMargin\": \"mean\",\n",
    "    \"TotalTaxRate\": \"mean\"\n",
    "})\n",
    "\n",
    "ranking[\"RevenueScore\"] = (\n",
    "    (ranking[\"Revenue\"] - ranking[\"Revenue\"].min()) /\n",
    "    (ranking[\"Revenue\"].max() - ranking[\"Revenue\"].min())\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "ranking[\"ProfitScore\"] = (\n",
    "    (ranking[\"Profit\"] - ranking[\"Profit\"].min()) /\n",
    "    (ranking[\"Profit\"].max() - ranking[\"Profit\"].min())\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "ranking[\"MarginScore\"] = (\n",
    "    (ranking[\"PostTaxProfitMargin\"] - ranking[\"PostTaxProfitMargin\"].min()) /\n",
    "    (ranking[\"PostTaxProfitMargin\"].max() - ranking[\"PostTaxProfitMargin\"].min())\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "ranking[\"TaxScore\"] = 1 - (\n",
    "    (ranking[\"TotalTaxRate\"] - ranking[\"TotalTaxRate\"].min()) /\n",
    "    (ranking[\"TotalTaxRate\"].max() - ranking[\"TotalTaxRate\"].min())\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "ranking[\"OverallScore\"] = (\n",
    "    ranking[\"RevenueScore\"]\n",
    "    + ranking[\"ProfitScore\"]\n",
    "    + ranking[\"MarginScore\"]\n",
    "    + ranking[\"TaxScore\"]\n",
    ") / 4\n",
    "\n",
    "ranking = ranking.sort_values(\"OverallScore\", ascending=False).reset_index()\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "ax5 = sns.barplot(\n",
    "    data=ranking,\n",
    "    x=\"State\",\n",
    "    y=\"OverallScore\",\n",
    "    hue=\"State\",\n",
    "    palette=\"viridis\",\n",
    "    legend=False,\n",
    "    edgecolor=\"black\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "for container in ax5.containers:\n",
    "    ax5.bar_label(container, fmt=\"%.2f\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.title(\"Overall State Performance Score\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"State\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Overall Score\", fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
